  unitName: Abyssal Wing Sae
  unitId: 820045
  unitNumber: 8035
  description: The pint-sized aquatic hybrid from beyond the abyss, overseer of the
    deepest depths beneath the ocean. Her small stature belies her tyrannical personality,
    a result of ages of being alone with nobody but her most loyal servants. After
    her inital, unsuccessful rampage, she quested for vengeance in an entire realm
    completely unknown to her. Through her journey, she slowly began to see the surface
    world in a different light, although her childish dreams of conquest would not
    be shaken. Starting to behave more like a true ruler, her powers eventually returned,
    stronger than ever before.
  summonDesc: It's time for me to reassume my role as Queen of the abyss~ Now, what
    should I conquer first...
  fusionDesc: So this is the path towards global domination... how enjoyable~
  evoDesc: Ufufu... bow before your new queen~! The time for conquest has finally
    arrived~
